---
import BuySection from './BuySection.astro';
---
<div id="dim-past" class="page">
  <div class="past-hero">
    <div class="past-hero-text">
      <div class="era-tag rv">3 · Past · Wardenclyffe · 1893</div>
      <h1 class="past-h1 rv d1">You are there.<br>In the <em>laboratory</em>.<br>1893.</h1>
      <p class="past-lead rv d2">The air smells of ozone. Tesla stands before a tower that should not exist — technology so advanced it took humanity 130 years to recreate on a blockchain.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="past-hero-cv"><canvas id="past-canvas"></canvas></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ticker amber"><div class="ttrack"><span>⚡ WARDENCLYFFE</span><span>·</span><span>1893</span><span>·</span><span>FREE ENERGY</span><span>·</span><span>TESLA</span><span>·</span><span>3 · 6 · 9</span><span>·</span><span>⚡ WARDENCLYFFE</span><span>·</span><span>1893</span><span>·</span><span>FREE ENERGY</span><span>·</span><span>TESLA</span><span>·</span><span>3 · 6 · 9</span><span>·</span></div></div>
  <div class="past-content">
    <div class="vid-frame past rv" data-reveal>
      <video src="/videos/tesla-reel.mp4" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/img/zapp-mascot.png" data-autoplay-inview></video>
      <span class="vid-cap">⚡ Wardenclyffe · The Reel</span>
    </div>
    <div class="past-grid">
      <div class="pc rv"><p class="pc-yr">2560 BC · Egypt</p><h3 class="pc-h">Humans built the <em>impossible</em>.</h3><p class="pc-p">The pyramids. The hanging gardens. Every civilisation left something that defied its time. Tesla was building the same — for everyone, not just kings.</p></div>
      <div class="pc rv d1"><p class="pc-yr">1899 · Wardenclyffe</p><h3 class="pc-h">Free energy at <em>light speed</em>.</h3><p class="pc-p">No meter. No bill. No gatekeeper. Wireless energy for every human on Earth. He was already building it when the money ran out.</p></div>
      <div class="pc rv d1"><p class="pc-yr">All History · The Pattern</p><h3 class="pc-h">Power always <em>controls</em> the energy.</h3><p class="pc-p">Pharaohs controlled the Nile. Kings controlled trade. Banks control money. The pattern repeats every century — until someone breaks it.</p></div>
      <div class="pc rv d2"><p class="pc-yr">The Frequency · 3 · 6 · 9</p><h3 class="pc-h">The key to the <em>universe</em>.</h3><p class="pc-p">Tesla wasn't obsessed with numbers. He was obsessed with truth. The pattern beneath all creation. The signal he built Wardenclyffe around.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="blueprint rv">
      <div class="blueprint-stamp">CONFIDENTIAL · 1903</div>
      <p class="blueprint-q">"Where do we put the <em>meter</em>?"</p>
      <p>J.P. Morgan's question when Tesla pitched free wireless energy. There was no answer. The funding was cut. The tower demolished in 1917. The monopoly survived 100 more years.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="past-tesla-q"><blockquote class="rv">"If you knew the magnificence of 3, 6 and 9, you would have a key to the universe."</blockquote><cite class="rv d1">Nikola Tesla · 1856–1943</cite></div>
    <div class="past-bridge rv"><h2>A century later,<br><em>Solana broke it</em>.</h2><p class="rv d1">65,000 transactions per second. $0.00025 per transaction. The meter J.P. Morgan demanded still doesn't exist here.</p><button class="btn-past rv d2" data-hub>↩ Back to Hub</button></div>
  </div>
  <BuySection />
</div>
